## Quick Summary

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Run code only if a condition is true | `if` |
| Choose between two paths | `if-else` |
| Test several conditions in order | `if-else-if` |
| Test a condition inside another | Nested `if` |
| Combine conditions | `&&`, `\|\|`, `!` |
| Many fixed values of one variable | `switch` |
| Safe text → number conversion | `TryParse` |
| Pick one option | RadioButton |
| Pick many options | CheckBox |
| Choose from a list | ListBox |

